            <ownedComment xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.XsdAnyUri-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#XsdAnyUri-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DataDescriptionWithStructure.XsdAnyUri"/>
               <body>Primitive data type "anyURI" of the XML Schema data types.

Definition from XML Schema Part 2: Datatypes Second Edition: "anyURI" represents a Uniform Resource Identifier Reference (URI). An "anyURI" value can be absolute or relative, and may have an optional fragment identifier (i.e., it may be a URI Reference). This type should be used to specify the intention that the value fulfills the role of a URI as defined by [RFC 2396], as amended by [RFC 2732]. For details see https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#anyURI.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>XsdAnyUri</name>
         </packagedElement>
         <packagedElement xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint" xmi:type="uml:DataType">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint"/>
               <body>Hash value (digital fingerprint) of the logical or physical representation of data.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>DataFingerprint</name>
            <ownedAttribute xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification" xmi:type="uml:Property">
               <ownedComment xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification"/>
                  <body>The algorithm used to compute the value of the fingerprint.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <lowerValue xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                  <value>1</value>
               </lowerValue>
               <upperValue xmi:id="DataDescriptionWithStructure.DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/data_structure/1.0/xmi/#DataFingerprint-algorithmSpecification-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                  <value>1</value>
               </upperValue>
               <name>algorithmSpecification</name>
